<title>MALTA: Malta indicative money market rates unchanged.</title>
<headline>Malta indicative money market rates unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indicative money market rates were unchanged at the begining of the week in Malta.</p>
<p>The Malta Central Bank said the weekly reverse repo (absorption) rate was 5.0 percent and the weighted average yield on Treasury bills was as follows:</p>
<p>    One month	 4.996</p>
<p>    Three months    4.997</p>
<p>    Six months	5.288</p>
<p>    One year	  5.360</p>
<p>The Central Bank discount rate is 5.5 percent.</p>
</text>
